Achmage Workbench — rhwp v0.9.0 form of a 0.8.7 engine patch (third_party/hop/patches-0.9.0).
Origin: HOP 0003 (third_party/hop/patches/0003-hop-canvas-synthetic-bold.patch, sha256 e1398a1bcc5e3e7221b40b850c061074d8799306f78552ffa0637c060b368391; original author hop-workbench <hop@localhost>)
