Differs from the 0.8.7 form: 0.9.0 already drops bold from the canvas font when the face has no bold and strokes after every fill (fill_positioned_text); applying the 0.8.7 code would stroke twice.
Regression test: renderer::canvas_text_font::tests::hop_0003_hallym_gothic_bold_is_synthetic_on_canvas (new)

From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: h4a <h4a@localhost>
